"Basic Construct Summoning": {
  "index": "-99",
  "category": "constructs",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Basic Summoning"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Constructs ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "can be summoned in a basic way by using an Armor Stand, then placing the five required construct parts on it. \n\nOnce done, activate the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Armor Stand",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " with "
        },
        {
          "text": "Animus Dust",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to summon your friend. \n\nConstructs can be modified once you reach tier 2, allowing you to change parts out and re-summon them.  To do so, command them to return to an empty "
        },
        {
          "text": "Construct Gantry",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nIt's worth noting that "
        },
        {
          "text": "Constructs cannot die (unless changed via config)",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", they will instead get knocked out until there are no hostiles within 16 blocks of them.  They can be revived early using a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Construct Repair Kit or by healing them for a cumulative total of 20 health.",
          "color": "blue"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "crafting",
      "location": "armor_stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "manaweaving_altar",
      "location": "mna:animus_dust"
    },
    {
      "type": "crafting",
      "location": "mna:construct_repair_kit"
    }
  ]
}